<title>USA: Keystone, North Star Plating to merge.</title>
<headline>Keystone, North Star Plating to merge.</headline>
<dateline>POMONA, Calif. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keystone Automotive Industries Inc said Tuesday it had agreed in principle to merge with North Star Plating Co. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The transaction will be accounted for as a pooling of interests and is subject to negotiation of a definitive agreement and shareholder and regulatory approval, Keystone said.</p>
</text>
